[FAIL] ingress.traefik_file     /data/traefik/weglarka.yml is not writable by weglarka (mode 0644, uid 0)
                                hint: `chown weglarka /data/traefik/weglarka.yml` and `chmod 0644 /data/traefik/weglarka.yml`
